&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/188514/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;dompdf.js 2.0&lt;/a&gt; – Converts HTML to multi-page PDFs in the browser.&lt;/p&gt;
