&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/188528/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Verdaccio 6.9&lt;/a&gt; – Self-hostable Node.js private proxy registry.&lt;/p&gt;
